{{Term/Store|Big Hearty Truffle|Big Hearty Truffles|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}},{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Spoils"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/> also known as '''White Hearty Truffles''',{{Exp Game|TotK}}<ref name="TotK Savrey"/> are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Big Hearty Truffle}}
Big Hearty Truffles are a more rare yet more effective version of the regular [[Hearty Truffle]]. Though they were once regular Hearty Truffles, being left unpicked for years and has caused them to grow larger.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can be found growing at the base of [[Tree]]s in the [[Hebra Mountains]] and the [[Great Hyrule Forest]].

Like all hearty-type foods, Big Hearty Truffles can be [[Cooking|Cooked]] in a [[Cooking Pot]] to restore [[Link]]'s [[Life Gauge]] and provide [[Extra Hearts]] at a higher potency than regular Hearty Truffles.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can be eaten for three [[Heart]]s, which is more than the normal Hearty Truffle. Big Hearty Truffles exposed to [[Fire]] become [[Toasted Big Hearty Truffle]]s. They can be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to create [[Black Dye]].

